# Admin checkboxes

Use the shared **admin checkbox** pattern for every new checkbox in the admin UI (not toggle switches like `cp-visit-toggle`).

## Markup

Prefer the partial:

```blade
@include('admin.partials.checkbox', [
    'name' => 'field_name',
    'id' => 'optional-id',
    'label' => 'Label text',
    'checked' => true,
    'hiddenFallback' => true, // when paired with hidden 0
    'class' => 'optional-extra-classes',
    'inputClass' => 'optional-hook-classes',
])
```

Or copy this structure:

```blade
<label class="admin-checkbox">
  <input type="checkbox" name="..." value="1" class="admin-checkbox__input">
  <span class="admin-checkbox__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="admin-checkbox__text">Label</span>
</label>
```

## CSS (`public/css/admin.css`)

- `.admin-checkbox` — default (24px mark, brand blue `#024768` when checked)
- `.admin-checkbox--sm` — compact (invoice totals, table rows)
- `.admin-checkbox--block` — full-width label + text wrap
- `.admin-checkbox__input--standalone` — overlay checkboxes (photo tiles) without a label wrapper

Checkbox always **left**, label text **right**.
